Package: TforT
Title: Calculate Costs from iMTA Cost Questionnaires
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Stijn", "Peeters", , "s.b.peeters@eshpm.eur.nl",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Calculates productivity costs from the iMTA Productivity Cost
    Questionnaire (iPCQ), using Dutch reference prices or user-supplied
    country-specific assumptions. Includes validation helpers, reproducible
    examples, and a Shiny interface for file-based calculations.
